==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Two Can]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly simple Dark themed stage with some Assassin Bears. The main idea is to fight Le'noir away from the surge base to avoid being sniped, then kill the Two Can and then the base.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]]: Stone is a great meatshield here, but more importantly it acts as a second line of defence against the Assassin Bears. Since stone is basically invincible, it can roll into the bears and one shot them. Great if you accidentally use your cannon too soon.
*[[Rugby Cat (Rare Cat)|Gridiron Cat]]: Gridiron can be used well here as it is strong against Darks and is immune to both waves and surges, allowing it to be safe from the Surge Base and the Two Can.
*[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]: Pizza outranges most of the enemies here, and can deal Massive Damage against anything it touches.
*Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]]: C.A.T is a powerful anti-Dark rusher that sort of just demolishes everything, being able to do Massive Damage to every enemy here and being nearly guaranteed multiple hits due to its rebound and speed.
*[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]: Can block the Two Can's waves and let your units survive a bit longer.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo/Ultra Jizo]]: Both Jizo's first and Ultra Forms tear this stage in half, being able to literally shoot everything to death easily. The Ultra Form is better due to the higher bulk and Surge Resist Talent, but is not required due to the high investment cost.
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]]: Yukimura works especially well in this stage due to it consisting of mostly Dark enemies, if using him, do beware about the surges as if timed incorrectly he will get oneshot.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]], the [[Assassin Bear]]s' strength magnification was 800% instead of 400%.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 4,200. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

